{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/GettingStarted"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Getting Started","modules":[{"name":"LoveLetterCore"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackClient","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackReport","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackType"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoveLetterCore"},{"text":" is designed to drop into any Apple-platform app with three lines of setup and one async call to submit. There are no global singletons, no compile-time configuration steps, and no UI dependencies.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Step-1-Add-the-package","text":"Step 1 — Add the package","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".package(path: \"..\/LoveLetterSDK\"),","\/\/ or, when published:","\/\/ .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/hayek\/LoveLetterSDK\", from: \"0.2.0\"),"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Link "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoveLetterCore"},{"type":"text","text":" to your app target. The SwiftUI sheet lives in the separate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoveLetterUI"},{"type":"text","text":" product — link that too if you want the drop-in form."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-2-Build-a-client","text":"Step 2 — Build a client"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construct a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackClient"},{"type":"text","text":" once at app start and hold a reference. Device info is collected lazily on every submission, so a long-lived client always reports the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"current"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" app version even after updates."}]},{"code":["import LoveLetterCore","","@MainActor","let feedback = FeedbackClient(","    appName: \"AcmeApp\",","    transport: GitHubDirectTransport(","        owner: \"acme-co\",","        repo: \"feedback\",","        token: SecretLoader.gitHubToken","    )",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"appName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter overrides the auto-detected app name (otherwise the SDK reads ","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleDisplayName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from your bundle).","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-3-Submit-a-report","text":"Step 3 — Submit a report"},{"code":["do {","    let issueNumber = try await feedback.submit(","        FeedbackReport(","            type: .bug,","            title: \"Crash on launch\",","            description: \"Happens immediately after sign-in.\",","            contactEmail: \"user@example.com\"","        )","    )","    print(\"Filed issue #\\(issueNumber)\")","} catch {","    \/\/ See ``FeedbackSubmissionError`` for the error cases the GitHub transport throws.","    print(\"Failed: \\(error)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That’s it. The transport renders the body, applies labels, calls GitHub, and returns the issue number."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-4-Inject-device-info-optional","text":"Step 4 — Inject device info (optional)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to override what ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/DeviceInfo\/current(appName:)"},{"text":" collects — for example, to distinguish iPad from iPhone or to inject test data — build a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/DeviceInfo"},{"text":" directly and pass it to the alternate ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackClient\/init(transport:deviceInfo:analytics:)"},{"text":" initializer:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let device = DeviceInfo(","    appName: \"AcmeApp\",","    appVersion: \"1.2.3\",","    buildNumber: \"456\",","    model: \"iPad14,1\",","    osName: \"iPadOS\",","    osVersion: \"Version 18.2 (Build 22C150)\"",")","let feedback = FeedbackClient(transport: transport, deviceInfo: device)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With this initializer the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deviceInfo"},{"text":" value is frozen for the lifetime of the client. Use it for tests, screenshots, or when you need full control of the metadata column.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Next steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/BodyFormat"},{"type":"text","text":" — see exactly what gets written to the GitHub issue body."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/CustomTransports"},{"text":" — replace ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/GitHubDirectTransport","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with a server-side relay.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/SecretsAndTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" — how to handle the GitHub PAT honestly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/lovelettercore\/gettingstarted"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackClient","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", submit a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackReport","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the SDK does the rest."}],"references":{"doc://LoveLetterCore/documentation/LoveLetterCore/FeedbackType":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"FeedbackType","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/lovelettercore\/feedbacktype","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackType","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FeedbackType","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Whether a feedback submission is a bug report or a feature request.","type":"text"}],"title":"FeedbackType","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://LoveLetterCore/documentation/LoveLetterCore":{"url":"\/documentation\/lovelettercore","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Submit feedback from any Apple platform to a GitHub repository in the exact body format the Love Letter inbox parses."}],"title":"LoveLetterCore","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://LoveLetterCore/documentation/LoveLetterCore/FeedbackClient":{"title":"Fe